{"speciesId":570,"names":{"fr":"Zorua","es":"Zorua","en":"Zorua","ja":"ゾロア"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a le pouvoir de prendre l’apparence des autres. On dit qu’il se transforme souvent en petit enfant silencieux."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It changes into the forms of others to surprise them. Apparently, it often transforms into a silent child."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il peut se transformer en humain ou en d’autres Pokémon. Il se protège du danger en dissimulant sa vraie identité."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It changes so it looks just like its foe, tricks it, and then uses that opportunity to flee."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It changes so it looks just like its foe, tricks it, and then uses that opportunity to flee."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il prend l’apparence de son adversaire pour le désorienter et prendre la fuite grâce à la confusion causée."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Adopta la apariencia de su enemigo para engañarlo vilmente y aprovecha su estupor para poner tierra por medio."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It changes so it looks just like its foe, tricks it, and then uses that opportunity to flee."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"相手そっくりに 化けているように みせかけ だましたり 驚かして そのすきに 逃げ出すことが 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut se transformer en humain ou en d’autres Pokémon. Il se protège du danger en dissimulant sa vraie identité."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se transforma en humanos o en otros Pokémon. Se defiende del peligro ocultando su verdadera apariencia."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"人や ほかの ポケモンに 化ける。 自分の 正体を 隠すことで 危険から 身を 守っているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il prend l’apparence de son adversaire pour le désorienter et prendre la fuite grâce à la confusion causée."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Adopta la apariencia de su enemigo para engañarlo vilmente y aprovecha su estupor para poner tierra por medio."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It changes so it looks just like its foe, tricks it, and then uses that opportunity to flee."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"相手そっくりに 化けているように みせかけ だましたり 驚かして そのすきに 逃げ出すことが 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il peut se transformer en humain ou en d’autres Pokémon. Il se protège du danger en dissimulant sa vraie identité."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Se transforma en humanos o en otros Pokémon. Se defiende del peligro ocultando su verdadera apariencia."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"人や ほかの ポケモンに 化ける。 自分の 正体を 隠すことで 危険から 身を 守っているのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Timide de nature, il change constamment d’apparence, sauf quand il est entouré de ses congénères."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es tan miedoso que, cuando no se halla junto a sus compañeros, casi siempre adopta un aspecto distinto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This Pokémon has a cowardly disposition, so when it’s not around friends, it basically always stays transformed as something else."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"臆病な 性質の ポケモンで 仲間と いるとき 以外は ほぼ 他の 誰かに 化けている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Si un enfant volubile a soudain perdu sa langue, méfiez-vous ! C’est peut-être un Zorua qui a pris son apparence..."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Si un niño parlanchín se vuelve taciturno, tal vez pueda tratarse en realidad de un Zorua que ha adoptado su aspecto."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"If a normally talkative child suddenly stops talking, it may have been replaced by Zorua."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"普段 おしゃべりな 子どもが 無口に なった ときは ゾロアが 入れ替わって いるかも しれないよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"À cause de sa timidité, il aurait développé la capacité de changer son apparence."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Al parecer, fue su carácter miedoso lo que le llevó a desarrollar la capacidad de transformarse."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Zorua is a timid Pokémon. This disposition seems to be what led to the development of Zorua’s ability to take on the forms of other creatures."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"なにかに 化ける 能力を 身に つけたのは 臆病な 性質の 影響らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il lui arrive de se changer en être humain, surtout en enfant, pour venir chercher de la nourriture en ville."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Suele transformarse en personas, sobre todo en niños, y se adentra en pueblos buscando comida."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Zorua sometimes transforms into a person and goes into cities to search for food. When Zorua does this, it usually takes on the form of a child."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"エサを もとめて 人に 化け 町に 現れることも あるぞ。 おもに 子どもに 化けている。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"A once-departed soul, returned to life in Hisui. Derives power from resentment, which rises as energy atop its head and takes on the forms of foes. In this way, Zorua vents lingering malice."}],"varieties":[{"id":570,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine